Z||000006||Oreif||12-16-2001||08:27 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by maryjane:<BR><B>Well, hate to bring up bad thoughts. I wasn't a member then, but when I first started reading this forum, I saw a thread involving Orief and someone else, a gutted cat, an egr valve and....the EPA. It was a riot to read, but probably not much fun to be involved in. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>The "EGR" thread, The "someone else" left. He was threatening to turn people into the EPA if they disconnected their EGR. He actually did report me. I received a letter from them and they dropped the matter since my car passed the last 5 emission tests. (Actually per my state the car has never failed!) Now my car is exempt so it doesn't matter. He ended up on one of the Yahoo Fiero Clubs and tried to do the same thing. They forced him out of the club. Last I heard he moved to Arizona next to a guy with a collection of Dictionaries.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>(Actually it wasn't too bad, I just kept turning his facts back around to him.)<p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 12-16-2001).]||||reg||1
